    {
        "id": 5,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   At this point... we're out of other options. Madam Ch'en, if you deny my request...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "At this point... we're out of other options. Madam Ch'en, if you deny my request..."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Rhodes Island will act alone.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Rhodes Island will act alone."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   These actions don't violate any of the terms of our cooperation.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "These actions don't violate any of the terms of our cooperation."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Of course we'll be there.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Of course we'll be there."
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...Is that so...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...Is that so..."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   In that case, thank you on behalf of Rhodes Island...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "In that case, thank you on behalf of Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I know that Lungmen still sees us as Infected...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I know that Lungmen still sees us as Infected..."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   It's not a big deal.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It's not a big deal."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   However, I'm not sure if our squads will be able to make it into the ruins.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "However, I'm not sure if our squads will be able to make it into the ruins."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We'll have to play it by ear.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We'll have to play it by ear."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   If the situation allows, we will definitely help.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If the situation allows, we will definitely help."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   However, our top priority is still to eliminate Reunion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "However, our top priority is still to eliminate Reunion."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   That... that's enough for us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "That... that's enough for us."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...Thank you, Madam Ch'en.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...Thank you, Madam Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Sorry, I have my own duties.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Sorry, I have my own duties."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Did you hear me, Doc?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Did you hear me, Doc?"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We will join up with Rhodes Island.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We will join up with Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=-1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Amiya, be careful.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Amiya, be careful."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   This won't be a simple task.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "This won't be a simple task."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I will.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I will."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=-1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Right, I've managed to put together some pieces of intel.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Right, I've managed to put together some pieces of intel."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Rhodes Island has already deployed rescue squads to assist the other recon squads.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Rhodes Island has already deployed rescue squads to assist the other recon squads."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   But Meteorite's squad is too far and we cannot reach them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "But Meteorite's squad is too far and we cannot reach them."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   This is where you come in.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "This is where you come in."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Only Meteorite's squad...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Only Meteorite's squad..."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I understand. I'll go look for them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I understand. I'll go look for them."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=-1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   I'll send you the coordinates later.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "I'll send you the coordinates later."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Remember, safety is your top priority.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Remember, safety is your top priority."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Understood."
    },
